       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LWDW@NR@.
      *===============================================================*
      * This program is a local wrapper for REST program LWDC@NR@.    *
      * @OP@
      * Generated by python/genlww.py from localwrapper.cbl.tpl.      *
      * LWW links here, in the routing region. LWDC@NR@ runs as DPL   *
      * program in a target region (DYNAMIC(YES)), where WEB READ has *
      * no web request to read. This wrapper reads the form fields    *
      * into the IO area in container LWW-LINK-PAR-03 and links to    *
      * LWDC@NR@ with SYNCONRETURN, so its SYNCPOINT is allowed.      *
      * LWDW@NR@ must be defined DYNAMIC(NO) so it runs locally.      *
      * ------------------------------------------------------------- *
      * Updates:                                                      *
      *                                                               *
      * Date     Who What                                             *
      * -------- --- ------------------------------------------------ *
      * yy/mm/dd ii  description                                      *
      *===============================================================*

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WORK.
           05  C-CHNL-NAME-LWW       PIC X(16) VALUE 'LWW-LINK-CHL-00'.
           05  C-CONT-NAME-LWW-00    PIC X(16) VALUE 'LWW-LINK-PAR-00'.
           05  C-CONT-NAME-LWW-03    PIC X(16) VALUE 'LWW-LINK-PAR-03'.
           05  C-PGM-LWDC@NR@        PIC X(8)  VALUE 'LWDC@NR@'.
           05  W-TRANSID             PIC X(4).
           05  W-CHNL-NAME           PIC X(16).
           05  W-CONT-NAME           PIC X(16).
           05  W-CONT-POINTER        POINTER.
           05  W-CONT-LENGTH         PIC S9(9) USAGE COMP-5.
           05  W-RETURNCODE          PIC X(2)  VALUE '00'.
           05  W-EIBRESP             PIC 9(8).
           05  W-EIBRESP2            PIC 9(8).

           05  SW-CONT-FOUND-VAL     PIC X     VALUE 'N'.
               88  SW-CONT-FOUND               VALUE 'Y'.
               88  SW-CONT-MISSING             VALUE 'N'.

           05  W-MSGPTR              PIC S9(4) BINARY.
           05  MSGDEST               PIC S9(9) BINARY VALUE 2.
           05  FC.
               10  Condition-Token-Value.
               COPY  CEEIGZCT.
                   15  Case-1-Condition-ID.
                       20  Severity    PIC S9(4) BINARY.
                       20  Msg-No      PIC S9(4) BINARY.
                   15  Case-2-Condition-ID
                             REDEFINES Case-1-Condition-ID.
                       20  Class-Code  PIC S9(4) BINARY.
                       20  Cause-Code  PIC S9(4) BINARY.
                   15  Case-Sev-Ctl    PIC X.
                   15  Facility-ID     PIC XXX.
               10  I-S-Info            PIC S9(9) BINARY.
           05  MSGSTR.
               10  Vstring-length    PIC S9(4) BINARY.
               10  Vstring-text.
                   15  Vstring-char  PIC X
                               OCCURS 0 TO 256 TIMES
                               DEPENDING ON Vstring-length
                                  of MSGSTR.

       01  W-LLWDM@NR@.
           COPY LLWDM@NR@.
       01  W-LINKPAR.
           COPY LINKPAR.
@FORMW@
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  P-CHAR                    PIC X.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN SECTION.
           PERFORM R001-INIT

           IF W-RETURNCODE = '00'
              PERFORM R050-READ-FORM
              PERFORM R004-PUT-IOAREA
           END-IF

           IF W-RETURNCODE = '00'
              PERFORM R005-LINK
           END-IF

           IF W-RETURNCODE NOT = '00'
              PERFORM R008-SET-ERROR
           END-IF

           EXEC CICS
              RETURN
           END-EXEC
           .

      *===============================================================*
      * R001-INIT: Get the IO area LWW put in LWW-LINK-PAR-03         *
      *===============================================================*
       R001-INIT SECTION.
           INITIALIZE W-LLWDM@NR@
           MOVE C-CHNL-NAME-LWW    TO W-CHNL-NAME
           MOVE C-CONT-NAME-LWW-03 TO W-CONT-NAME

           PERFORM R910-GET-CONTAINER

           IF SW-CONT-FOUND
              SET ADDRESS OF P-CHAR TO W-CONT-POINTER
              IF W-CONT-LENGTH > LENGTH OF W-LLWDM@NR@
                 MOVE LENGTH OF W-LLWDM@NR@ TO W-CONT-LENGTH
              END-IF
              MOVE P-CHAR(1:W-CONT-LENGTH) TO W-LLWDM@NR@
           ELSE
              MOVE '08' TO W-RETURNCODE
           END-IF
           .
       R001-INIT-END.
           EXIT.

      *===============================================================*
      * R004-PUT-IOAREA: The IO area with the form fields, for        *
      * LWDC@NR@                                                      *
      *===============================================================*
       R004-PUT-IOAREA SECTION.
           MOVE C-CHNL-NAME-LWW       TO W-CHNL-NAME
           MOVE C-CONT-NAME-LWW-03    TO W-CONT-NAME
           MOVE LENGTH OF W-LLWDM@NR@ TO W-CONT-LENGTH
           SET W-CONT-POINTER TO ADDRESS OF W-LLWDM@NR@

           PERFORM R920-PUT-CONTAINER
           .
       R004-PUT-IOAREA-END.
           EXIT.

      *===============================================================*
      * R005-LINK: Link to LWDC@NR@ with the LWW channel. No SYSID,   *
      * so the dynamic routing program picks the target region.       *
      * TRANSID: the mirror runs under our own tranid, defined there  *
      * with PROGRAM(DFHMIRS). SYNCONRETURN: the mirror is its own    *
      * unit of work, so LWDC@NR@ may commit and roll back. CICS      *
      * ignores both when LWDC@NR@ runs locally.                      *
      *===============================================================*
       R005-LINK SECTION.
           MOVE EIBTRNID TO W-TRANSID

           EXEC CICS
              LINK PROGRAM(C-PGM-LWDC@NR@)
                   CHANNEL(C-CHNL-NAME-LWW)
                   TRANSID(W-TRANSID)
                   SYNCONRETURN
                   NOHANDLE
           END-EXEC

           IF EIBRESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
              MOVE '08' TO W-RETURNCODE

              MOVE EIBRESP  TO W-EIBRESP
              MOVE EIBRESP2 TO W-EIBRESP2
              MOVE 256 TO Vstring-length
              MOVE 1 TO W-MSGPTR
              STRING 'LINK LWDC@NR@ ERROR ' W-EIBRESP ' ' W-EIBRESP2
                     DELIMITED BY SIZE
                INTO Vstring-text
                WITH POINTER W-MSGPTR
              COMPUTE Vstring-length = W-MSGPTR - 1
              CALL 'CEEMOUT' USING MSGSTR, MSGDEST, FC
           END-IF
           .
       R005-LINK-END.
           EXIT.

      *===============================================================*
      * R008-SET-ERROR: LWDC@NR@ did not run (or a container could    *
      * not be read or put): answer 500 with 08 91 (docs/04-api.md).  *
      *===============================================================*
       R008-SET-ERROR SECTION.
           MOVE N'08' TO RETURNCODE OF W-LLWDM@NR@
           MOVE N'91' TO REASONCODE OF W-LLWDM@NR@
           MOVE N'LINK to LWDC@NR@ failed' TO
                INFOMESSAGE OF W-LLWDM@NR@

      *    Keep the LWW fields LWW put in LWW-LINK-PAR-00.
           INITIALIZE W-LINKPAR
           MOVE C-CHNL-NAME-LWW    TO W-CHNL-NAME
           MOVE C-CONT-NAME-LWW-00 TO W-CONT-NAME

           PERFORM R910-GET-CONTAINER

           IF SW-CONT-FOUND
              SET ADDRESS OF P-CHAR TO W-CONT-POINTER
              IF W-CONT-LENGTH > LENGTH OF W-LINKPAR
                 MOVE LENGTH OF W-LINKPAR TO W-CONT-LENGTH
              END-IF
              MOVE P-CHAR(1:W-CONT-LENGTH) TO W-LINKPAR
           END-IF

           MOVE 500 TO STSCODE OF W-LINKPAR
           MOVE 21  TO STSTXTL OF W-LINKPAR
           MOVE 'Internal Server Error' TO STSTXTT OF W-LINKPAR

           PERFORM R004-PUT-IOAREA

           MOVE C-CHNL-NAME-LWW     TO W-CHNL-NAME
           MOVE C-CONT-NAME-LWW-00  TO W-CONT-NAME
           MOVE LENGTH OF W-LINKPAR TO W-CONT-LENGTH
           SET W-CONT-POINTER TO ADDRESS OF W-LINKPAR

           PERFORM R920-PUT-CONTAINER
           .
       R008-SET-ERROR-END.
           EXIT.

@FORMP@      *===============================================================*
      * R910-GET-CONTAINER: Get container W-CONT-NAME                 *
      *===============================================================*
       R910-GET-CONTAINER SECTION.
           EXEC CICS
              GET CONTAINER(W-CONT-NAME)
                  CHANNEL(W-CHNL-NAME)
                  SET(W-CONT-POINTER)
                  FLENGTH(W-CONT-LENGTH)
                  NOHANDLE
           END-EXEC

           IF EIBRESP = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
              SET SW-CONT-FOUND TO TRUE
           ELSE
              SET SW-CONT-MISSING TO TRUE

              IF  EIBRESP NOT = DFHRESP(CHANNELERR)
              AND EIBRESP NOT = DFHRESP(CONTAINERERR)
                 MOVE '08' TO W-RETURNCODE

                 MOVE EIBRESP  TO W-EIBRESP
                 MOVE EIBRESP2 TO W-EIBRESP2
                 MOVE 256 TO Vstring-length
                 MOVE 1 TO W-MSGPTR
                 STRING 'GET CONTAINER ERROR ' W-EIBRESP ' ' W-EIBRESP2
                        DELIMITED BY SIZE
                   INTO Vstring-text
                   WITH POINTER W-MSGPTR
                 COMPUTE Vstring-length = W-MSGPTR - 1
                 CALL 'CEEMOUT' USING MSGSTR, MSGDEST, FC
              END-IF
           END-IF
           .
       R910-GET-CONTAINER-END.
           EXIT.

      *===============================================================*
      * R920-PUT-CONTAINER: Put container W-CONT-NAME                 *
      *===============================================================*
       R920-PUT-CONTAINER SECTION.
           SET ADDRESS OF P-CHAR TO W-CONT-POINTER

           EXEC CICS
              PUT CONTAINER(W-CONT-NAME)
                  CHANNEL(W-CHNL-NAME)
                  FROM(P-CHAR)
                  FLENGTH(W-CONT-LENGTH)
                  NOHANDLE
           END-EXEC

           IF EIBRESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
              MOVE '08' TO W-RETURNCODE

              MOVE EIBRESP  TO W-EIBRESP
              MOVE EIBRESP2 TO W-EIBRESP2
              MOVE 256 TO Vstring-length
              MOVE 1 TO W-MSGPTR
              STRING 'PUT CONTAINER ERROR ' W-EIBRESP ' ' W-EIBRESP2
                     DELIMITED BY SIZE
                INTO Vstring-text
                WITH POINTER W-MSGPTR
              COMPUTE Vstring-length = W-MSGPTR - 1
              CALL 'CEEMOUT' USING MSGSTR, MSGDEST, FC
           END-IF
           .
       R920-PUT-CONTAINER-END.
           EXIT.

       END PROGRAM LWDW@NR@.
